# Anchor with a leading slash so we only exclude the top-level design
# canon. Without the anchor, `*.md` matches every markdown file at any
# depth and silently strips agent prompts (src/game/agents/prompts/*.md)
# and content markdown (content/**/*.md) from the lambda bundle — which
# crashes /api/session/new with a FileNotFoundError.
/*.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/ENGINEERING.md
.scratch

web/.next
web/node_modules
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
web/tests
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
